id: sturdy-shell
name: Sturdy Shell
order: 18
naturalArmor: Shell
naturalArmorQuality: dense-armor
description: >
  Your body is protected by a heavy duty shell. Once your defenses are broken, however, you become much more agile. (by Idios of the DBU Discord)
text: >
  Sturdy Shell: Your body is protected by a heavy duty shell. Once your defenses are broken, however, you become much more agile. (by Idios of the DBU Discord)
  (1)-[Passive, Ruling]: Upon gaining this Bestial Trait, gain a ‘Shell’. Your Shell is Natural Armor (see — Natural Armor).
  (2)-[Passive]: Your Shell gains the Dense Armor Apparel Quality. This Quality does not occupy any Quality Slots.
  (3)-[Passive]: While your Shell is unbroken, halve any Collision Damage you would suffer.
  (4)-[Triggered/Threshold]: You may reduce your Shell’s Break Value by 1 to increase your Dice Score for this Health Threshold’s Steadfast Check by 1.
  (5)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If your Shell is broken, increase your Combat rolls by ½ of its Apparel Bonus (rounded up) until the end of your next turn.

---

[passive]
# (1), (2) Its header's `naturalArmor` and `naturalArmorQuality`: the Shell made on the Gear tab, Dense Armor on it in no Slot.
# (3) While it is Active and not broken (chat.mjs collisionHalved).
allow shell.collision;
# (4) A box in the Steadfast Check's window while it has Break Value: 1 of it for 1 (chat.mjs rollSteadfastCheck).
allow shell.steadfast;
# (5) Broken in a Combat Encounter: asked, once an Encounter - half its Apparel Bonus (rounded up) on your Combat Rolls till the
# end of your next turn (dbu-ttrpg.mjs, the hook that sees it break; Shell Burst, its mark).
allow shell.burst;
